    question: 'A bar chart shows monthly website visitors (in thousands) for Jan–Jun: Jan=80, Feb=75, Mar=90, Apr=110, May=105, Jun=120.\n\nBetween which two consecutive months did the LARGEST increase occur, and what was the percentage increase?',
