    subtopic: 'Sequences',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    question: 'A sequence is defined by a₁ = 3 and aₙ = 2aₙ₋₁ − 1 for all n ≥ 2. What is a₆₀?\n\nA. 2⁵⁹ + 1\nB. 2⁵⁹ · 3 − 1\nC. 2⁵⁹ + 2\nD. 2⁵⁸ · 3 + 1\nE. 3 · 2⁵⁹ − 2',
