    section: 'Quant',
    type: 'PS',
    topic: 'Problem Solving',
    subtopic: 'Advanced Coordinate Geometry',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    question: 'In the xy-plane, a circle has center (3, −2) and passes through the point (7, 1). A line tangent to this circle at the point (7, 1) intersects the y-axis at point P. What is the y-coordinate of P?\n\nA. 37/4\nB. 41/3\nC. 43/4\nD. 11\nE. 47/4',
