    type: 'DS',
    topic: 'Number Theory',
    subtopic: 'GCD and LCM',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    question: 'What is the greatest common divisor of positive integers m and n?\n\n(1) m = 2n\n(2) The least common multiple of m and n is 48.',
