    section: 'Verbal',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    topic: 'Subject-Verb Agreement',
    question: 'The proliferation of single-use plastics in coastal regions, despite numerous international treaties and local bans, remain a persistent challenge for environmental regulators worldwide.',
