    type: 'SC',
    section: 'Verbal',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    topic: 'Idioms',
    question: 'The negotiating team was not so much interested in reaching a comprehensive agreement as they were in establishing a framework that could be revisited in subsequent sessions.',
