    section: 'Verbal',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    topic: 'Idioms',
    question: 'The task force concluded that the spike in cybersecurity breaches was attributed to both the proliferation of poorly secured IoT devices as well as the increasing sophistication of state-sponsored hacking groups.',
