    section: 'Verbal',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    topic: 'Weaken',
    question: 'City planners in Westville propose building a network of protected bicycle lanes throughout downtown. They argue that similar projects in comparable cities reduced car traffic by 25% on average, and that Westville should expect the same outcome. Which of the following, if true, most seriously weakens the planners\' prediction?',
