    section: 'Verbal',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    topic: 'Strengthen',
    question: 'A financial analyst argues that interest rate cuts by the central bank will stimulate consumer spending because lower rates reduce the cost of borrowing, enabling consumers to take on more debt to finance purchases. Which of the following, if true, most strengthens this argument?',
