    type: 'CR',
    section: 'Verbal',
    difficulty: 'hard',
    topic: 'Assumption',
    question: 'A city government is considering replacing all downtown parking meters with a mobile app-based payment system. The transportation director argues that this will reduce administrative costs because the city will no longer need to pay meter maintenance crews or collect coins from thousands of meters. Which of the following is an assumption upon which the transportation director\'s argument depends?',
