    question: 'Two students, Alex and Jordan, took tests in four subjects. Their scores (out of 100) are:\n\nSubject | Alex | Jordan\nMath    |  88  |   76\nScience |  72  |   85\nHistory |  65  |   90\nEnglish |  91  |   78\n\nFor the two-part question below, select ONE answer for "Alex\'s stronger subject relative to Jordan" and ONE answer for "Jordan\'s stronger subject relative to Jordan (the subject with the greatest positive score gap in Jordan\'s favor)." Each answer must come from the list and each can be used at most once.\n\nChoices: Math, Science, History, English, Neither has a stronger subject',
